       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. square-root.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-NUMBER PIC 9(32).
       01 WS-SQRT PIC 9(32).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
          PERFORM SQUARE-ROOT.
       STOP RUN.

       SQUARE-ROOT.
         COMPUTE WS-SQRT = WS-NUMBER ** 0.5.

